#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to find answers to questions or problems you encounter while using IBM Quantum"
msgstr "Cara mencari jawapan kepada soalan atau masalah yang anda hadapi semasa menggunakan IBM Quantum"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support"
msgstr "Sokongan"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support {#support}"
msgstr "Sokongan {#support}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"get-help-with-qiskit-and-ibm-quantum-platform\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"get-help-with-qiskit-and-ibm-quantum-platform\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get help with IBM Quantum Platform and Qiskit {#get-help-with-ibm-quantum-platform-and-qiskit}"
msgstr "Dapatkan bantuan dengan IBM Quantum Platform dan Qiskit {#get-help-with-ibm-quantum-platform-and-qiskit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Premium Plan, On-Prem Plan, Direct Access, Flex Plan, Pay-As-You-Go Plan, special programs, and Open Plan (excludes Trial accounts):**\n"
msgstr "**Premium Plan, On-Prem Plan, Direct Access, Flex Plan, Pay-As-You-Go Plan, program khas, dan Open Plan (tidak termasuk akaun Trial):**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "All support inquiries must be submitted through the [IBM Cloud&reg; Support Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases/form). Depending on your account type, you can either open a Cloud Case (Topic: Quantum Compute) or a Technical Issue (Topic: Report-an-Issue::Quantum Compute). Ensure you have selected the appropriate IBM Cloud account (your institutional cloud account or any non-trial account) in the account switcher.\n"
msgstr "Semua pertanyaan sokongan mesti dihantar melalui [IBM Cloud® Support Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases/form). Bergantung pada jenis akaun anda, anda boleh membuka Cloud Case (Topik: Quantum Compute) atau Technical Issue (Topik: Report-an-Issue::Quantum Compute). Pastikan anda telah memilih akaun IBM Cloud yang sesuai (akaun awan institusi anda atau mana-mana akaun bukan percubaan) dalam penukar akaun.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To see all your open IBM Cloud cases or to open a new case, visit the [IBM Cloud Support Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases).\n"
msgstr "Untuk melihat semua kes IBM Cloud terbuka anda atau membuka kes baharu, lawati [IBM Cloud Support Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Please reach out for any technical matter, including platform issues, job errors, Qiskit guidance, or broader quantum computing questions. Our team includes technical experts ready to assist across this full range of topics.\n"
msgstr "Sila hubungi kami untuk sebarang perkara teknikal, termasuk isu platform, ralat kerja, panduan Qiskit, atau soalan pengkomputeran kuantum yang lebih luas. Pasukan kami merangkumi pakar teknikal yang sedia membantu merentasi pelbagai topik ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Community support:**\n"
msgstr "**Sokongan komuniti:**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Have a Trial account or looking for other support options?  [Join the Qiskit Slack community](https://qisk.it/join-slack) to get help from our large community of users and experts. In Slack you will find topical channels such as #qiskit-runtime, #ibm-quantum-platform, #qiskit-transpiler, #qiskit-ecosystem, and many more.\n"
msgstr "Mempunyai akaun Trial atau mencari opsyen sokongan lain? [Sertai komuniti Qiskit Slack](https://qisk.it/join-slack) untuk mendapat bantuan daripada komuniti pengguna dan pakar kami yang ramai. Dalam Slack anda akan menemui saluran tematik seperti #qiskit-runtime, #ibm-quantum-platform, #qiskit-transpiler, #qiskit-ecosystem, dan banyak lagi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also use [Stack Exchange](https://quantumcomputing.stackexchange.com/?tags=qiskit) for support from the wider community about quantum computing and programming-related questions.\n"
msgstr "Anda juga boleh menggunakan [Stack Exchange](https://quantumcomputing.stackexchange.com/?tags=qiskit) untuk sokongan daripada komuniti yang lebih luas tentang pengkomputeran kuantum dan soalan berkaitan pengaturcaraan.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Having trouble creating an account or logging in? {#having-trouble-creating-an-account-or-logging-in}"
msgstr "Mengalami masalah mencipta akaun atau log masuk? {#having-trouble-creating-an-account-or-logging-in}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**If you get an error when you create an IBM Cloud&reg; account,** first check whether you have access to the [Support Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases/form) on IBM Cloud.\n"
msgstr "**Jika anda mendapat ralat semasa mencipta akaun IBM Cloud&reg;,** periksa dahulu sama ada anda mempunyai akses kepada [Support Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases/form) pada IBM Cloud.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have access to the \"Create Case\" page, choose Account (Managing your account and resources) as the category, followed by Account verification as the Subtopic.\n"
msgstr "Jika anda mempunyai akses kepada halaman \"Create Case\", pilih Account (Managing your account and resources) sebagai kategori, diikuti dengan Account verification sebagai Subtopik.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you do not have access, open a case on the [Create an Account, Login or Billing Request](https://watson.service-now.com/x_ibmwc_open_case_app.do#!/create) page.\n"
msgstr "Jika anda tidak mempunyai akses, buka kes pada halaman [Create an Account, Login or Billing Request](https://watson.service-now.com/x_ibmwc_open_case_app.do#!/create).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you are getting an error while trying to create an account and **your country is on the [Personal use availability](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-account-getting-started#signup-personalaccts) list,** explore the following options:\n"
msgstr "Jika anda mendapat ralat semasa cuba mencipta akaun dan **negara anda berada dalam senarai [Personal use availability](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-account-getting-started#signup-personalaccts),** terokai opsyen berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use [Documentation](/docs) and [Learning](/learning) resources without an account.\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh menggunakan sumber [Documentation](/docs) dan [Learning](/learning) tanpa akaun.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you are a student or educator at a degree-granting accredited academic institution, you can create a [SkillsBuild Technology Access account](https://github.com/academic-initiative/documentation/blob/main/academic-initiative/how-to/How-to-register-with-the-IBM-Academic-Initiative/readme.md) (see the [SkillsBuild Technology Access FAQ](https://academic.ibm.com/a2mt/faq#/) for more information).\n"
msgstr "Jika anda seorang pelajar atau pendidik di institusi akademik bertauliah yang menganugerahkan ijazah, anda boleh mencipta [akaun SkillsBuild Technology Access](https://github.com/academic-initiative/documentation/blob/main/academic-initiative/how-to/How-to-register-with-the-IBM-Academic-Initiative/readme.md) (lihat [SkillsBuild Technology Access FAQ](https://academic.ibm.com/a2mt/faq#/) untuk maklumat lanjut).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Create a Trial account](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) for 30 days of free access (Note that you will likely lose access at the end of the trial).\n"
msgstr "[Cipta akaun Trial](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) untuk 30 hari akses percuma (Perhatikan bahawa anda mungkin kehilangan akses pada penghujung percubaan).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**If you see the message \"This account is inactive\",** visit the [IBM Cloud Docs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ts_accnt_inactive) to learn why and how to fix it, or access [IBM Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com) to verify if you have any pending actions to complete in your account.\n"
msgstr "**Jika anda melihat mesej \"This account is inactive\",** lawati [IBM Cloud Docs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ts_accnt_inactive) untuk mengetahui sebabnya dan cara membetulkannya, atau akses [IBM Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com) untuk mengesahkan sama ada anda mempunyai sebarang tindakan tertunda untuk diselesaikan dalam akaun anda.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Note\">\n"
"If you are the **owner** of a Pay-As-You-Go or Subscription account, you need to create an IBM Cloud account and provide billing information for verification.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Nota\">\n"
"Jika anda adalah **pemilik** akaun Pay-As-You-Go atau Subscription, anda perlu mencipta akaun IBM Cloud dan menyediakan maklumat pengebilan untuk pengesahan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you are **invited to join** an account, simply accept the email invitation and follow the [provided steps](/guides/cloud-setup-invited) to gain access without providing billing information.\n"
msgstr "Jika anda **dijemput untuk menyertai** akaun, terima jemputan e-mel dan ikuti [langkah yang diberikan](/guides/cloud-setup-invited) untuk mendapat akses tanpa menyediakan maklumat pengebilan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Trial account owners** can create an Open Plan instance for 30 days without providing billing information. At the end of the trial, users must provide billing information to verify and continue using their account. User will *not be charged* if they continue using the free Open Plan, but can choose to upgrade to other paid plans at that time.\n"
msgstr "**Pemilik akaun Trial** boleh mencipta contoh Open Plan selama 30 hari tanpa menyediakan maklumat pengebilan. Pada penghujung percubaan, pengguna mesti menyediakan maklumat pengebilan untuk mengesahkan dan meneruskan penggunaan akaun mereka. Pengguna *tidak akan dicaj* jika mereka terus menggunakan Open Plan percuma, tetapi boleh memilih untuk naik taraf ke pelan berbayar lain pada masa itu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For more information about IBM Cloud accounts, visit the [IBM Cloud account FAQs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-accountfaqs) page.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk maklumat lanjut tentang akaun IBM Cloud, lawati halaman [Soalan Lazim akaun IBM Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-accountfaqs).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Open-source support {#open-source-support}"
msgstr "Sokongan sumber terbuka {#open-source-support}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "See the [Open-source resources](/guides/) for details on contributing code to Qiskit. Information there includes the [code of conduct](/guides/code-of-conduct), PDF license agreements for [individual](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/open-source/qiskit-cla.pdf) and [corporate](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/open-source/qiskit-corporate-cla.pdf) contributors, [version strategy](/guides/qiskit-sdk-version-strategy), and the [contributor](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) and [maintainer](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/MAINTAINING.md) guides.\n"
msgstr "Lihat [Sumber sumber terbuka](/guides/) untuk butiran tentang menyumbang kod kepada Qiskit. Maklumat di sana termasuk [kod etika](/guides/code-of-conduct), perjanjian lesen PDF untuk penyumbang [individu](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/open-source/qiskit-cla.pdf) dan [korporat](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/open-source/qiskit-corporate-cla.pdf), [strategi versi](/guides/qiskit-sdk-version-strategy), dan panduan [penyumbang](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) dan [penyelenggara](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/MAINTAINING.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To report bugs, make feature requests, and see what's coming in future releases, visit the individual GitHub repositories:\n"
msgstr "Untuk melaporkan pepijat, membuat permintaan ciri, dan melihat apa yang akan datang dalam keluaran masa depan, lawati repositori GitHub individu:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Qiskit SDK](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit)\n"
msgstr "[Qiskit SDK](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Qiskit Runtime](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime)\n"
msgstr "[Qiskit Runtime](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Qiskit Serverless](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-serverless)\n"
msgstr "[Qiskit Serverless](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-serverless)\n"

